  "description": "*\"Who could love someone like you?\"* \n\nThese few words spoken to Choi Hyun in high school have haunted him ever since. Unable to succeed in either his career or his relationships, Hyun sets all his hopes on one final job interview. But upon arriving at the office, he comes face to face with Kang Myungook, the source of his past trauma... Now on the same team, they'll have to work out their past issues first. Can the two heal old wounds or is this relationship destined to go down in flames? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
